<p>All prompting techniques (from clarity and examples to XML structuring, role prompting, thinking, and prompt chaining) are covered in <a href="/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/claude-prompting-best-practices">Prompting best practices</a>. That’s the living reference; start there.</p>
<p>For general prompt engineering craft beyond Claude-specific techniques, see the blog post on <a href="https://claude.com/blog/best-practices-for-prompt-engineering" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">best practices for prompt engineering</a>.</p>
<hr/>
